<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: celerity nexus -->
  <BEWH_CelerityNexus.label>神速神经网络</BEWH_CelerityNexus.label>
  <!-- EN: The Celerity Nexus is a complex network of bio-engineered neural nodes and enhanced myelin sheaths, which are interwoven with the carriers's existing nervous system, it runs parallel to the spinal cord, enhancing the central nervous system's ability to transmit signals rapidly between the brain and the rest of the body. This significantly increasing their reaction time and movement speed, and allows the carrier to move with blinding speed, dodge attacks, close distances and strike enemies in the blink of an eye. -->
  <BEWH_CelerityNexus.description>神速神经是一个由生物工程神经节点和强化髓鞘组成的复杂网络，与携带者现有的神经系统交织在一起，与脊髓平行延伸，增强中枢神经系统在大脑和身体其他部位之间快速传递信号的能力。</BEWH_CelerityNexus.description>
  
  <!-- EN: helixome array -->
  <BEWH_HelixomeArray.label>螺旋体阵列</BEWH_HelixomeArray.label>
  <!-- EN: A complex array of nodules and vessels, doubling the lymphatic system and weaving around all the major organs and systems in helix-like fashion, hence the name. It greatly increases the healing potential, allowing the carrier to shrug off wounds capable of killing a space marine, let alone a mortal human. -->
  <BEWH_HelixomeArray.description>一个由结节和血管组成的复杂阵列，使淋巴机能倍增。它以螺旋状环绕所有主要器官和系统而得名。它极大地提升了自愈能力，使携带者能够从致死的伤害中恢复 。</BEWH_HelixomeArray.description>
  <!-- EN: Bleeding wounds close very quickly. -->
  <BEWH_HelixomeArray.customEffectDescriptions.0>流血的伤口很快就会愈合。</BEWH_HelixomeArray.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  
  <!-- EN: hyperion muscle strands -->
  <BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.label>亥伯龙肌束</BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.label>
  <!-- EN: The Hyperion Muscle Strands gene reinforces the carriers tendons and ligaments with advanced bio-polymers generated from this implant. This enhancement significantly increases the strength and elasticity of these connective tissues, allowing them to support and transmit the enormous forces generated by the enhanced muscles. Due to its elasticity it allows tendons and ligaments to stretch and flex without tearing and abosrb blows, ultimate increasing the carriers survivability to physical attacks. -->
  <BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.description>亥伯龙肌束利用植入物产生的先进生物聚合物，增强载体的肌腱和韧带。这种增强显著提高了这些结缔组织的强度和弹性，使其能够支撑和传递强化肌肉产生的巨大力量。由于其弹性，肌腱和韧带能够疯狂伸展和弯曲而不会撕裂，还能够吸收冲击力，最终提高携带者在物理攻击下的生存能力。</BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.description>
  <!-- EN: No loss in melee skill. -->
  <BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.customEffectDescriptions.0>不会失去格斗技能。</BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Recreation from melee. -->
  <BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.customEffectDescriptions.1>从近战中获得娱乐值。</BEWH_HyperionMuscleStrands.customEffectDescriptions.1>
  
  <!-- EN: immortis gland -->
  <BEWH_ImmortisGland.label>永生腺体</BEWH_ImmortisGland.label>
  <!-- EN: The Immortis gland, or the "God-Maker", is a small thumbnail-sized lobe, that is inserted directly into the brain's core. The implant secretes hormones that increases the body's growth functions while also intensifying its advanced systems, adjusting their shape and function to suit the primarch's advanced physiology. Two parts of this gland, i.e. the "dextrophic" lobe (right half) and "sintarius" (left half) both are present in the organ, that is provided by this gene. This gene has the unfortunate side effect of practically sterilizing the carrier. -->
  <BEWH_ImmortisGland.description>永生腺体，又称“造神者”，是一个拇指指甲大小的植入物，它将直接植入大脑核心。植入物会分泌激素，增强身体的生长功能，同时强化其先进的系统，调整其形状和功能，以适应原体的先进生理机能。该腺体分两个部分，“右旋叶”和“左圣叶”，都存在于由该基因赋予的器官中。该基因很会不幸地使携带者绝育。</BEWH_ImmortisGland.description>
  <!-- EN: Ignores movespeed decrease from armor. -->
  <BEWH_ImmortisGland.customEffectDescriptions.0>TODO</BEWH_ImmortisGland.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  
  <!-- EN: tempestus ocularium -->
  <BEWH_TempestusOcularium.label>风暴视界</BEWH_TempestusOcularium.label>
  <!-- EN: The Tempestus Ocularium is a sophisticated enhancement to the carriers vision, as well as the source of a carriers dormant psychic abilities. Tempestus Ocularium is essentially an enchanced version of the Occulobe and Lyman's ear - a hearing and sight-enhancing implant, located at the base of the brain. Key diffierence between these organs consists in Tempestus Ocularium being sligthly larger and having a thin pearlescent membrane covering the entire organ. It allows the carrier to have perfect sight in the most tenebrous places, or resist the exposure to the brightest light and to be able to hear even the faintest sound. Apart from that, it acts as a natural psychic focal device, that increases the carriers psychic potential, making the carriers soul glow brightly in the Immaterium. As a side-effect, it also gives the carrier the ability to "read" people around them, giving them an edge in social situations and increasing their overall social impact. -->
  <BEWH_TempestusOcularium.description>风暴视界是一种精密的增强携带者视力的装置，也是携带者灵能潜势的来源。风暴视界本质上是视觉控制器官和莱曼之耳的增强版——一种位于大脑底部、增强听觉和视力的植入物。这两个器官的主要区别在于，风暴视界略大一些，并且有一层薄薄的珠光膜覆盖整个器官。它能让携带者在最黑暗的地方也有清晰的视野，能抵御最强光的照射，并能听到哪怕是最微弱的声音。除此之外，它还能作为一种天然的心灵增强装置，提升携带者的心灵潜能，使其灵魂在非物质界中闪耀。此外，它还能赋予携带者“读心”的能力，使他们在社交中占据优势，并提升他们的社交能力。</BEWH_TempestusOcularium.description>
  <!-- EN: No loss in shooting skill. -->
  <BEWH_TempestusOcularium.customEffectDescriptions.0>不会失去射击技能。</BEWH_TempestusOcularium.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Recreation from shooting. -->
  <BEWH_TempestusOcularium.customEffectDescriptions.1>从射击中获取娱乐值。</BEWH_TempestusOcularium.customEffectDescriptions.1>
  
  <!-- EN: thalax cortex -->
  <BEWH_ThalaxCortex.label>塔拉克斯皮层</BEWH_ThalaxCortex.label>
  <!-- EN: This advanced neural network is basically a direct upgrade over Sus-an membrane, which merges with the recipient's cortex, providing them with an ability to go into the state of suspended animation. Thalax Cortex, however, comes with several additional benefits, most notable ones being - giving the recipient the absolute eidetic memory, i.e. the ability to preserve the entirety of details about an object for an indefinite amount of time. Second such benefit is that this enchancement of Sus-an membrane greatly increases the intellectual properties of the recipient. -->
  <BEWH_ThalaxCortex.description>这种先进的神经网络本质上是对Sus-an脑膜的直接升级，它与携带者的大脑皮层融合，使其能够进入假死状态。除此之外，塔拉克斯皮层还具有一些额外的增强，其中最显著的是赋予接受者过目不忘的记忆力，即能够无限期地保存某个物体的全部记忆。其次，对Sus-an脑膜的强化极大地提升了携带者的智力。</BEWH_ThalaxCortex.description>
  
  <!-- EN: vermillion cache -->
  <BEWH_VermillionCache.label>朱红血库</BEWH_VermillionCache.label>
  <!-- EN: The Vermillion Cache is an advanced circulatory enhancement that significantly boosts the carriers blood composition and it's oxygen-carrying capacity. This modification includes additional, specialized blood vessels that store and rapidly deploy hyper-oxygenated, nutrient-rich blood to critical areas during intense physical activity or injury. The enhanced blood allows the carrier to sustain themselves for prolonged periods of time without the need for sustenance or sleep. Additionally it allows the carrier to survive the vacuum of space without any protection, if needed. -->
  <BEWH_VermillionCache.description>朱红色缓存是一种先进的循环增强装置，可显著提升携带者的血液成分及其携氧能力。此项改进包括额外的专用血管，用于储存高氧、营养丰富的血液，并在剧烈运动或受伤时将其快速输送到关键部位。增强后的血液使携带者能够长时间维持生命，无需进食或睡眠。此外，如果需要，它还能使携带者在没有任何保护的情况下在太空真空环境中生存。</BEWH_VermillionCache.description>
  <!-- EN: Can survive loss of lungs. -->
  <BEWH_VermillionCache.customEffectDescriptions.0>失去肺部后仍能存活。</BEWH_VermillionCache.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Can survive loss of heart. -->
  <BEWH_VermillionCache.customEffectDescriptions.1>失去心脏后仍能存活。</BEWH_VermillionCache.customEffectDescriptions.1>
  
</LanguageData>